 "notes": "4 sheets (Views A-D), all checked. Units: note 6 'UNITS: INCHES'; note 4 says values in square brackets are millimetres (only the 2X Ø.315 callout on sheet 4 has them: '2X Ø.315 ±.008 [8 ±0.2]' with position 'Ø.030 [0.76] A B C' - recorded in inches only; the bracketed mm figures are not separate rows). Material from note 5: 'MATERIAL: (.1195 THICK) 11 GA 304 SST SHT, ASTM A240.' - recorded as designation contains '304', standard 'ASTM A240', stock thickness 0.1195 (inches, as printed); material group NOT complete (family / grade wording left to the reader). Notes: 6 numbered notes on sheet 1 plus the 'Notes -' blocks on sheet 3 (2 paragraphs) and sheet 4 (2 paragraphs), one row per paragraph. Projected tolerance zones (P) .260 on the sheet-1 composite position frames are not encoded. Sheet 1: two '3X Ø.250 +.003 -.000' callouts each with composite position Ø.050(P).260 A B C over Ø.010(P).260 A; '2X Ø.234 ±.008' position Ø.016(M) A B C; 'Ø.234 ±.008' position Ø.016 A B (datum C); 'Ø.234 ±.008' perpendicularity Ø.016 A (datum B); flatness .01 (datum A); profile .05 A B C all-around; '4X .03 ±.01 X .03 ±.01' recorded as ONE chamfer row (type 'chamfer', nominal .03 ±.01, count 4). Sheet 2: slot callouts '2X 1.00 ±.02' position .06(M) A B C BOUNDARY, '2X .25 ±.01' position .02(M) A B C BOUNDARY, '.375 ±.008 X 1.500 ±.012' position .030(M) A B C BOUNDARY (all-around; recorded as two linear rows), '4X Ø.250 ±.008' position Ø.030 A B C (datum F), profile .02 A F(M) all-around; '4X R' and '2X R' carry no value (not recorded); the dash-dot circle with arrows is a view indicator, not a datum. Sheet 3: polar-coordinate position frames .01 A G H (x3, one under '3X Ø.156 ±.008'), '3X' position .03 A G H, 'Ø.375 ±.008' with position Ø.040 A B C over perpendicularity Ø.010 A (datum G), '.140 ±.008' position .010 A G B (datum H), profile .008 A G H. Sheet 4: 'Ø.750 ±.008' position Ø.050 A B C over perpendicularity Ø.010 A (datum D), '2X Ø.221 ±.008' position Ø.020 A D B (datum E), two '2X Ø.156 ±.008' position Ø.025(M) A D(M) E(M) 'SEP REQT', '3X' position .060 A B C, '3X Ø.281 ±.008' perpendicularity Ø.010 A, '3X' position .020 A B C, '2X Ø.315 ±.008' position Ø.030 A B C. tolerance.tightest = Ø.250 +.003/-.000 (band .003). Naming rule used for Ø callouts: a callout with an 'nX' count, THRU / depth, or an uppercase (hole) fit is recorded as hole.diameter {diameter, count, upper, lower}; any other Ø size is a dimension {type:'diameter'}. Tolerances are recorded as signed deviations upper/lower; limit dimensions as max/min. GD&T: characteristic in words, datums = the datum letters in order (datum-reference modifiers not encoded), modifiers 'MMC' / 'LMC' = circled M / L after the tolerance value, diameterZone true only where Ø precedes the tolerance."
